[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C04_SEPAL_FILES]
The Sepal Files: Root Cause

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C04_SEPAL_FILES_desc]
§gThe Sepal protects The Flower. The Sepal protects The Truth. The Sepal protects Innocence. The Sepal protects Harmony.§!
The Sepal Militia has been reorganized into the Sepal Intelligence Agency, responsible for preventing Imperial infiltration, safeguarding the truth of cases, maintaining the operation of Stratusburg, and ensuring that the good and pure Harmony is not destroyed.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C04_SEPAL_FILES]
萼叶档案：寻根究底

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C04_SEPAL_FILES_desc]
§g萼叶守护花朵，萼叶守护真相，萼叶守护纯真，萼叶守护谐律§!
萼叶民兵已改组为萼叶情报局，负责防范帝国渗透、守护案件真相、维持层云堡的运转、确保善良而纯真的谐律不被破坏。
